    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chess of doom is a chess-based roguelike where you're outnumbered at every turn. Harness the dungeon's power to battle enemy hordes, familiar and strange. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DIE, LEARN, MASTER, CONQUER!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run challenges the player in a procedurally generated dungeon where every turn matters. Battle through rooms with twisted rules and challenges, facing classic and bizarre chess pieces.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE POWER WITHIN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the dungeon's power with souls and gambits. Souls grant unique move sets, letting the player  traverse the complex layouts and outsmart relentless foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 50 gambits to discover. Redefining strategies and bending game rules. Combine them to turn the tide in you favour!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chess of doom is a chess-based roguelike where you're outnumbered at every turn. Harness the dungeon's power to battle enemy hordes, familiar and strange. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DIE, LEARN, MASTER, CONQUER!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run challenges the player in a procedurally generated dungeon where every turn matters. Battle through rooms with twisted rules and challenges, facing classic and bizarre chess pieces.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE POWER WITHIN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the dungeon's power with souls and gambits. Souls grant unique move sets, letting the player  traverse the complex layouts and outsmart relentless foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 50 gambits to discover. Redefining strategies and bending game rules. Combine them to turn the tide in you favour!</p>",
    "short_description": "Chess of doom is a chess-based roguelike where you're outnumbered at every turn. Harness the dungeon's power to battle enemy hordes, familiar and strange. Die, learn, master, conquer!",
